VILNIUS TECH – APA 7th edition for LaTeX

This work may be distributed and/or modified under the conditions of the
LaTeX Project Public License, version 1.3c.

The latest version of this license is available at:

https://www.latex-project.org/lppl/lppl-1-3c/

This repository contains a LaTeX wrapper package developed by VILNIUS TECH.
The wrapper does not contain the source code of the separate `biblatex-apa`
package.

`biblatex-apa` is an external dependency distributed under its own license.
Its source code is not included in this repository and is not relicensed
by this project.
